<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/abf98b10-b93a-4674-a3e5-0eff117f3634-01/Procedure/ae7a0c8b-9fab-4b01-b017-93fb680856b3>
  a epo:Procedure;
  epo:foreseesTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/abf98b10-b93a-4674-a3e5-0eff117f3634-01/ProcurementProjectContractTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProject1>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/abf98b10-b93a-4674-a3e5-0eff117f3634-01/ProcurementProjectContractTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProject1_RealizedLocation1>;
  epo:hasEstimatedValue <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/abf98b10-b93a-4674-a3e5-0eff117f3634-01/MonetaryValueProcedure$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProject1_RequestedTenderTotal1>;
  epo:hasInternalIdentifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/abf98b10-b93a-4674-a3e5-0eff117f3634-01/Procedure/Identifier/1329>;
  epo:hasLegalBasis <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/legal-basis/32014L0024>;
  epo:hasMainFeature """The contracting authority has carried out a renewed assessment of the tenders received in the competition. Both received tenders have, thus, been rejected, cf. the Public Procurement Regulations § 24-8, first section, letter b.
The rejections are due to the tenders containing price holding for costs determined by a third party. The conditions will mean that the offered price cannot be seen as fully binding and comparable and it involves uncertainty in relation to the price comparison and the financial risks included in the contract.
As all tenders have been rejected, there is no longer a basis for entering into a contract with the competition. The contracting authority has therefore decided to cancel the competition.
The cancellation is due to the fact that no tender offer has been received that could form the basis for the award of contract, and has been decided to ensure compliance with the basic principles of non-discrimination, predictability and verifiability, cf. the Procurement Act § 4.
After an overall assessment, the contracting authority has concluded that there is a justifiable reason to cancel the competition, cf. The Public Procurement Regulations § 25-4. The tender contest is therefore completely cancelled.

The tender contest will be republished.
"""@en;
